# PSR-4b-whyDenali — neutral `whySection` gate

## Scope

| Work | Done |
| --- | --- |
| Rename generated/marketing gate `whyDenali` → `whySection` | Yes |
| Dual-read deprecated `whyDenali` in assert/codegen | Yes |
| Update product manifests + workspace-create scaffold | Yes |
| Rename CSS `data-marketing-home-*` / narrative docs sweep | **No** |

## Design

- Canonical boolean: `guestLanding.sections.whySection`
- Deprecated alias: `whyDenali` accepted only when `whySection` absent
- Conflict (both present, unequal) → fail closed
- Generated SDK type emits **only** `whySection`

## Exit gate

| Check | Result |
| --- | --- |
| Generated has `whySection`, not `whyDenali` | required |
| Four guestLanding manifests use `whySection` | required |
| Marketing/SDK section gate specs green | required |
| Smoke `psr-4b-whyDenali-smoke.mjs` green | required |
